\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  When Divine mercy falls on you\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Craving your full conversion
\par Make an effort for your spirit
\par To totally be transformed.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Try the narrow door to enter;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Walk along the narrow lane;
\par Part from sin and sensuous pleasure,
\par Turn your eyes unto heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Thro' supplication and pleading,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Go before your Lord daily;
\par Do not play down on your prayer
\par Both at night and in the day.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  May your love be rendered deeper,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That your first love may succeed
\par In transforming you thoroughly
\par Into the fold of the Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  And if you've been truly rescued,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That is just the beginning;
\par You have not accomplished all yet;
\par More still lie ahead of you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Hold steadfast unto your saviour,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Daily hold yourself with care;
\par For, each day some foes are present,
\par Waiting only to destroy.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7.  Hold strongly to what you've got now,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 That no one may take from you;
\par Hold onto the faith truthfully,
\par Make your journey, well prepared.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  8.  Move on forward, ne'er turning back,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Brave yourself and fight strongly;
\par Flee the viles of man and satan,
\par And your submission maintain.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  9.  Yield not to desires of the flesh,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Give no compromise to lust;
\par Should you relax your comportment,
\par You may too soon get defiled.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10. Regard worldly wastes with hatred,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  Arrogance, Bullying, detest;
\par  Tread with care and full readiness,
\par Never shall you be sluggish.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 11\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 11.  The worldly exist in their sins,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj That condemnation shall be.
\par Hold yourself removed from their fold;
\par Run hastily for your life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 12\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 12. In the fear of God hold yourself;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Daily follow your saviour,
\par And some day He will rescue you;
\par \pard     To live with Him forever.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

